  "details": "For headsets with wider fov it would be nice to adjust the hud to the edge of your view so they are less distracting and in the way of things. A A slider in the quick menu would be nice for widening or shortening your fov. Also the option to mirror your hud so the mute button and all notifications are on the right side, this may be useful for users blind in one eye or have trouble seeing. I can’t think of much else other than maybe being able to change the colour of the mute icon or make it so it doesn’t flash, these are less important and are more just last minute thoughts. Thank you",
